            "title": "U.S. 10-Year Treasury Yield Still at Higher End of Historic Range",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The 10-year Treasury yield remains at the higher end of its range since 2008, UBS strategists said in a note. This could allow scope for them to fall further, they said. Treasury yields have fallen in recent weeks on a growing conviction that Federal Reserve rate cuts are on their way.",
